        <mxCell id="legend_box" value="&lt;b&gt;QUY ƯỚC QUAN HỆ &amp;amp; BẢN SỐ (CROW&#39;S FOOT / SQL SERVER ERD):&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;—|— (ERone / 1)&lt;/b&gt;: Quan hệ 1 bắt buộc (Primary Key Table)&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;—o|— (ERzeroToOne / 0..1)&lt;/b&gt;: Quan hệ 0..1 tùy chọn (Vãng lai Walk-in, Check-in gán phòng, Cọc chưa có hóa đơn)&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;—&amp;lt;— (ERmany / ∞)&lt;/b&gt;: Quan hệ Nhiều (Foreign Key Table / Crow&#39;s Foot)&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;1 : 1&lt;/b&gt; — Single Identity Subtype (Accounts - Staff/Customer, Bookings - Invoices)" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#707070;strokeWidth=1;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
